      "title_type": 1,
      "description": "Swicy Buldak is made just for you — a milder option that lets more people enjoy the Buldak experience!\n\n\n\nSpicy Level 1\n\n\n\nAbout\n\nA perfect harmony created by the blend of Buldak’s spiciness and sweetness.\n\n\n\nA spice level 1 product designed for consumers who prefer a milder level of heat compared to the original Buldak.\n\n\n\nFeatures an iconic topping — bold, crunchy star-shaped sugar sprinkles!\n\n\n\nHow to Cook\n\n1.Drain\n\nAdd the noodles to 20 oz (600 mL) of boiling water. Cook for 5 1/2 minutes. Drain all the water.\n\n\n\n2. Add & Mix\n\nAdd the sauce and sweet sprinkles. Stir well and enjoy.\n\n\n\nLove the taste of Buldak but can't handle the heat? Samyang's Buldak Swicy delivers the perfect balance of Sweet and Spicy, with Sweet Sprinkles to mellow out the intensity without losing that signature Buldak taste- it's the best of both worlds! Elevate your mealtime with the irresistible flavors of Samyang's Buldak Swicy today!",
